{"sid": "SENT-0116", "text": "他的速度慢我三分钟。", "candidate_ids": ["AUTH-TAD-0254"]}
{"sid": "SENT-0117", "text": "他离开家乡一年了。", "candidate_ids": ["AUTH-TAD-0392"]}
{"sid": "SENT-0118", "text": "他经常不来学校。", "candidate_ids": ["AUTH-TAD-0209"]}
{"sid": "SENT-0119", "text": "他经常帮我的忙。", "candidate_ids": ["AUTH-TAD-0417"]}
{"sid": "SENT-0120", "text": "他经常放学后去打工。", "candidate_ids": ["AUTH-TAD-0493"]}
{"sid": "SENT-0121", "text": "他经常问老师问题。", "candidate_ids": ["AUTH-TAD-0471"]}
{"sid": "SENT-0122", "text": "他起初没明白，后来才理解了游戏的规则。", "candidate_ids": ["AUTH-TAD-0166"]}
{"sid": "SENT-0123", "text": "他那里保存着每年的检查报告。", "candidate_ids": ["AUTH-TAD-0433"]}
