{"sid": "SENT-0130", "text": "你先坐会儿，我马上回来。", "candidate_ids": ["AUTH-TAD-0175"]}
{"sid": "SENT-0131", "text": "你先把位置留着，我马上就来。", "candidate_ids": ["AUTH-TAD-0260"]}
{"sid": "SENT-0132", "text": "你出国以后，妈妈时刻想念着你。", "candidate_ids": ["AUTH-TAD-0213"]}
